    "text": "<blockquote><p>The speed of light can be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Rearrange equation (1) to obtain the required quantity.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Use the method of dimensional analysis to obtain the dimension of the required quantity.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>",
